class=\"fn\">b</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.combaMul_spec","kind":"theorem","line":1009,"name":"MPN.W32.combaMul_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/Comba.lean#L1009-L1060"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.combaMul\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">combaMul</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.CombaOK\">CombaOK</a> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Basic.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"All `a.size + b.size` limbs of `a * b` by Comba's method, one column at a time, into\n`a.size + b.size + 1` limbs whose top limb, which only held a carry, is dropped. The columns come\nfrom `combaOuter` when either operand is shorter than `w` limbs and from `combaOuterW` otherwise:\nthe column loop of `combaOuterW` adds whole products and counts the wraps of its sum, which is\n5–13% faster from 32 limbs on Zen 3, but setting up its unrolled loop for each column made\nproducts of 2 to 16 limbs 5–8% slower, also when both loops shared one function and chose by\ncolumn length.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.combaMul","kind":"def","line":934,"name":"MPN.W32.combaMul","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/Comba.lean#L934-L966"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.instDecidableCombaOK\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">instDecidableCombaOK</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Decidable\">Decidable</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.CombaOK\">CombaOK</a> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.instDecidableCombaOK","kind":"instance","line":928,"name":"MPN.W32.instDecidableCombaOK","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/Comba.lean#L928-L929"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.CombaOK\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">CombaOK</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Prop</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The conditions under which `combaMul` runs: nonempty operands, and sizes that fit.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.CombaOK","kind":"def","line":923,"name":"MPN.W32.CombaOK","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/Comba.lean#L923-L926"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.colSum_sq\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">colSum_sq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">la</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.colSum\">colSum</a> <span class=\"fn\">la</span> <span class=\"fn\">la</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.colPart\">colPart</a> <span class=\"fn\">la</span> <span class=\"fn\">la</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span> ((<span class=\"fn\">k</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HDiv.hDiv\">/</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.sqDiagCol\">sqDiagCol</a> <span class=\"fn\">la</span> <span class=\"fn\">k</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A column of a square is twice its products below the diagonal, `i < k - i`, plus the diagonal:\nthe products `aᵢ a_{k-i}` and `a_{k-i} aᵢ` are equal.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.colSum_sq","kind":"theorem","line":164,"name":"MPN.W32.colSum_sq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/Comba.lean#L164-L197"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.sqDiagCol\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">sqDiagCol</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">la</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The diagonal term of column `k` of a square: `a_{k/2}²` when `k` is even.","docLink":"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.sqDiagCol","kind":"def","line":160,"name":"MPN.W32.sqDiagCol","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN32/Arch/Comba.lean#L160-L162"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN32/Arch/Comba.html#MPN.W32.weighted_eq\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">W32</span>.<span class=\"name\">weighted_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">la </span><span class=\"fn\">lb</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/UInt32/Slice.html#ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice\">ScalarArray.UInt32Array.Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">N</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span 